#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix.md:323
msgid "Shebang interpreter"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix.md:325
msgid ""
"The `nix` command can be used as a `#!` interpreter. Arguments to Nix can be "
"passed on subsequent lines in the script."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix.md:328
msgid ""
"Verbatim strings may be passed in double backtick (``` `` ```) quotes. <!-- "
"that's markdown for two backticks in inline code. --> Sequences of _n_ "
"backticks of 3 or longer are parsed as _n-1_ literal backticks. A single "
"space before the closing ``` `` ``` is ignored if present."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix.md:332
msgid ""
"`--file` and `--expr` resolve relative paths based on the script location."
msgstr ""

